msgid "Quarkus client API for data sources"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus exposes a high-level API on top of Redis.\n"
"This API is type-safe and structured around the notion of _group_, inherited "
"from the https://redis.io/commands/command-docs/[Redis command organization]."
"\n"
"This API lets you execute Redis commands more conveniently and safely."
msgstr ""

